<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>GhostWhisper — third-party licenses</title>
  <style>
    :root { color-scheme: light dark; }
    body {
      font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
      max-width: 52rem;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    h1 { margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
    .intro p { margin: 0.4rem 0; }
    ul.overview { columns: 2; padding-left: 1.25rem; }
    ul.overview li { break-inside: avoid; }
    .license {
      margin: 2rem 0;
      padding-top: 1rem;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.4);
    }
    .license h3 { margin: 0 0 0.5rem; }
    .license p { margin: 0.25rem 0; }
    ul.used-by { columns: 2; padding-left: 1.25rem; margin: 0.25rem 0 1rem; }
    ul.used-by li { break-inside: avoid; }
    pre.text {
      white-space: pre-wrap;
      max-height: 22rem;
      overflow-y: auto;
      padding: 0.75rem;
      border: 1px solid rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.4);
      border-radius: 0.4rem;
      font-size: 0.85em;
    }
    a { color: inherit; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="intro">
    <h1>GhostWhisper — third-party licenses</h1>
    <p>GhostWhisper is &copy; HMRDSmoke Software LLC and released under the GNU General Public License, version 3 only.</p>
    <p>It is built from the open-source Rust crates and C/C++ libraries listed
    below, including <a href="https://github.com/ggml-org/whisper.cpp">whisper.cpp</a>
    and ggml, which are compiled into the binary. Their license texts are
    reproduced here as those licenses require. This page is generated by
    <a href="https://github.com/EmbarkStudios/cargo-about">cargo-about</a> from
    the exact dependency versions used in the build.</p>
  </div>

  <h2>Licenses in use</h2>
  <ul class="overview">
    {{#each overview}}
    <li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
    {{/each}}
  </ul>

  <h2>License texts</h2>
  {{#each licenses}}
  <section class="license">
    <h3 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h3>
    <p>Used by:</p>
    <ul class="used-by">
      {{#each used_by}}
      <li><a href="{{#if crate.repository}}{{crate.repository}}{{else}}https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}{{/if}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a></li>
      {{/each}}
    </ul>
    <pre class="text">{{text}}</pre>
  </section>
  {{/each}}
</body>
</html>
